== codex-config.toml (toml)
mcp_servers.unifi-fabric.env_vars:
  # MANUAL: UNIFI_DRY_RUN is forwarded from the environment Codex starts in: migrate that environment (--env), then list the new names here; see https://github.com/swkstudios/unifi-fabric-mcp-server/blob/v0.7.1/docs/MIGRATING-0.7.1.md
[mcp_servers.unifi-fabric.env]:
  - UNIFI_READ_ONLY
  - UNIFI_ENABLE_INNERSPACE_WRITE
  + UNIFI_WRITE_POLICY=deny
  + UNIFI_WRITE_EXCEPTIONS=family:innerspace=deny
  replace the lines above in that table with:
  UNIFI_WRITE_POLICY = "deny"
  UNIFI_WRITE_EXCEPTIONS = "family:innerspace=deny"
Some settings need a decision (# MANUAL above); see https://github.com/swkstudios/unifi-fabric-mcp-server/blob/v0.7.1/docs/MIGRATING-0.7.1.md
